# 大きな図形 (docs/private/fixed-buffer-audit.md 10), for tools/ui_run.py:
# a figure of 10000 rectangles and two lines of 2000 points each (more than
# the 256 shapes and 1024 points a shape the figure editor took before),
# made as a copy of 画用紙 (mkbig) and opened by 基本図形編集 (a process);
# everything picked and moved to the tray (トレーへ移動) and back
# (トレーから移動), the tray holding all of it; the figure saved by closing,
# opened again and found whole. What the process says after each command
# ("figure: shapes N picked M") tells how many shapes there are and how many
# are picked; the times are taken on the host from the key to that line
# ("time ...").
# Keys: A 04, X 1B, Z 1D, E 08 with Ctrl (01).
mkbig fig 10000 2000
logmark
hostmark
open big
expectsincein 120 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 10002
hosttime open 30000
wait 1000
shot big_fig_open
logmark
hostmark
key 04 01
expectsincein 60 figure: shapes 10002 picked 10002
hosttime pickall 10000
logmark
hostmark
key 1B 01
expectsincein 120 figure: shapes 0 picked 0
hosttime cut 30000
logmark
hostmark
key 1D 01
expectsincein 120 figure: shapes 10002 picked 10002
hosttime moveback 60000
wait 1000
shot big_fig_back
logmark
hostmark
key 08 01
expectsincein 120 figure: closed
hosttime closed 30000
sum
keep saved
logmark
hostmark
open big
expectsincein 120 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 10002
hosttime reopen 30000
wait 1000
logmark
key 08 01
expectsincein 60 figure: closed
sum
same saved
absent !OACV!
